# Public frontend configuration (not a secret).
#
# Local development (default): relative path through the Vite proxy → Fastify.
# Deployed frontend: set this to the API Gateway base URL (no hardcoded prod URL).
#
# Examples:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://xxxxxxxx.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
